        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ayushmann Khurrana\n- Companies: Miraj Group\n- Awards: Filmfare Awards\n- Films: Andhadhun, Gauri: The Unborn\n- Topics: Indian actors, musicians\n\nFacts:\n- Ayushmann Khurrana is an Indian actor and musician.\n- Ayushmann Khurrana was nominated in 2018 for the Filmfare Award for Best Actor.\n- Ayushmann Khurrana received the 2018 Best Actor Filmfare nomination for his performance in Andhadhun.\n- Miraj Group produced Andhadhun.\n- Miraj Group also produced Gauri: The Unborn.",
